 34P  c  2005Ol04: E=215 MeV {+36}S beam was produced using the       
 34P 2c  combination of XTU tandem Van de Graaff accelerator and ALPI           
 34P 3c  superconducting linear accelerator at the INFN Legnaro National        
 34P 4c  Laboratory. The target was 14-mg/cm{+2} 97.8% enriched {+176}Yb on a   
 34P 5c  35-mg/cm{+2} {+208}Pb backing. |g rays deexciting projectile-like and  
 34P 6c  target-like fragments were detected using the GASP array of 40 HPGe    
 34P 7c  Compton-suppressed detectors and an inner ball of 80 BGO crystals.     
 34P 8c  Measured E|g, I|g, and |g|g-coin. Deduced levels, J, |p. Comparisons   
 34P 9c  with shell-model calculations.                                         
